r;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Ribcracker\" title=\"Ribcracker\">Ribcracker III</a>:</b> On Critical Hit: 7 to 42 Bludgeoning damage from weapons with a x2 Critical Multiplier, 7 to 56 Bludgeoning damage from weapons with a x3 Critical Multiplier, and 7 to 70 Bludgeoning damage from weapons with a x4 or greater Critical Multiplier.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#DDA0DD;border-color:#225F22}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.green>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Green\"]{background-color:#90EE90;border-color:#6F116F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.yellow>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Yellow\"]{background-color:#EEE8AA;border-color:#111755}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.blue>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Blue\"]{background-color:#87CEFA;border-color:#783105}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.red>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Red\"]{background-color:#FA8072;border-color:#057F8D}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.colorless>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Colorless\"]{background-color:#F8F8FF;border-color:#070700}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.sun>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Sun\"]{background-color:#FFFFC0;border-color:#00003F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.moon>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Moon\"]{background-color:#C0FFFF;border-color:#3F0000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a{border:1px solid;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 3px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a{color:#003366}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a:visited{color:#040050}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.tooltip::after{content:\" augments.\"}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment red\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Red Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Red_augments\" title=\"Category:Red augments\">Red</a> and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Fanged_Wraps.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Fanged_Wraps.png/420px-Fanged_Wraps.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"500\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Fanged_Wraps.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>These crude handwraps are lined with the teeth of various predators.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>The Vicious attribute gives more damage, but at a price to the wearer. <a href=\"/page/Path_of_Inevitable_Dominion\" title=\"Path of Inevitable Dominion\">Path of Inevitable Dominion</a> Monks will likely bypass these, but <a href=\"/page/Path_of_Harmonious_Balance\" title=\"Path of Harmonious Balance\">Path of Harmonious Balance</a> Monks that use <a href=\"/page/Healing_Ki\" title=\"Healing Ki\">Healing Ki</a> can use its healing curse to offset the Vicious effect. <a href=\"/page/Update_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Update 3\">Update 3</a> added this item to the list of possible end reward choices for the  <a href=\"/page/Assault_on_Splinterskull\" title=\"Assault on Splinterskull\">Assault on Splinterskull</a> quest chain end-reward.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817210219\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.091 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.155 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3949/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26660/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7580/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 18/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n106.75%  146.328     46 Template:IO\n100.00%  137.070      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  137.070      1 -total\n 96.24%  131.914      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 38.34%   52.548      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 37.22%   51.014      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 35.27%   48.338      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 33.42%   45.804      2 Template:InCategory\n 22.38%   30.675      6 Template:Popup\n 15.72%   21.546      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:10497-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817210219 and revision id 672352. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -